{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/09ecf640f05cce384bf043112cbdc104.poster.avif?t=1773696595\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/09ecf640f05cce384bf043112cbdc104.webm?t=1773696595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/09ecf640f05cce384bf043112cbdc104.mp4?t=1773696595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up suddenly on the cold floor of an old train car. The lights flicker, the metal groans, and there is no memory of how you got there. There is no map, no explanation \u2014 only the sound of the train pushing forward into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is against you. The train never stops. With every door you open, the tension rises. Solving the puzzles is the key to moving forward, and escaping may be the only way to uncover the truth\u2026 if there\u2019s still time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/725591dc8c308f1fe126d48c7169731e.poster.avif?t=1773696595\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/725591dc8c308f1fe126d48c7169731e.webm?t=1773696595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/725591dc8c308f1fe126d48c7169731e.mp4?t=1773696595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable monster:</strong> An enemy that hunts you through the corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claustrophobic atmosphere:</strong> Dynamic lighting, ambient sounds, and a tense soundtrack that immerse you in horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent puzzles:</strong> Challenges that adapt to your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented narrative:</strong> Documents and notes scattered throughout the train reveal the truth behind the terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/d19a155dd1bc02a8acb3c593c28e2e5c.avif?t=1773696595\" width=1156 height=650 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the train and escape before it\u2019s too late?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734560?t=1773696595","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734560?t=1773696595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/92bc797447e664d7aaea3e9ef05e32b021c8ca5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773696595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/92bc797447e664d7aaea3e9ef05e32b021c8ca5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773696595","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4387320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb